{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0094-binary-tree-inorder","title":"LeetCode 94 二叉树的中序遍历","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0094-binary-tree-inorder","wordCount":1051,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-94-二叉树的中序遍历\">LeetCode 94 二叉树的中序遍历</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个二叉树的根节点 <code>root</code>，返回它的<strong>中序遍历</strong>结果。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>树中节点数目在范围 <code>[0, 100]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = [1, null, 2, 3]&#10;     1&#10;      \\&#10;       2&#10;      /&#10;     3&#10;输出：[1, 3, 2]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [1, null, 2, 3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1, 3, 2]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = []&#10;输出：[]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = [1]&#10;输出：[1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>进阶：</strong> 递归算法很简单，你可以通过迭代算法完成吗？</p>\n<p>二叉树的遍历是树结构的基础操作。中序遍历（左 → 根 → 右）的特殊性在于：对于二叉搜索树（BST），中序遍历的结果是有序的。本题将深入讲解递归和迭代两种实现方式，以及 Morris 遍历这一空间优化方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"三种遍历顺序回顾\">三种遍历顺序回顾</h3><p>二叉树的深度优先遍历有三种顺序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>遍历方式</th>\n<th>访问顺序</th>\n<th>记忆口诀</th>\n<th>BST 特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前序（Preorder）</td>\n<td>根 → 左 → 右</td>\n<td>根在前</td>\n<td>第一个是根</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中序（Inorder）</td>\n<td>左 → 根 → 右</td>\n<td>根在中</td>\n<td>升序排列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后序（Postorder）</td>\n<td>左 → 右 → 根</td>\n<td>根在后</td>\n<td>最后一个是根</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"递归法\">递归法</h3><p>中序遍历的递归实现是最自然的方式：先递归遍历左子树，然后访问当前节点，最后递归遍历右子树。递归的终止条件是节点为空。</p>\n<p>递归法的优点是代码简洁、逻辑清晰。缺点是当树的深度很大时，可能导致调用栈溢出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"迭代法-显式栈\">迭代法（显式栈）</h3><p>迭代法使用显式栈来模拟递归的调用栈。核心思路是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从根节点出发，沿左子树一直往下走，将沿途节点压入栈中</li>\n<li>当左子树走到头（当前节点为空），从栈中弹出一个节点，记录其值</li>\n<li>然后转向该节点的右子树，重复上述过程</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个过程本质上是在手动管理递归的「暂停」和「恢复」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"morris-遍历\">Morris 遍历</h3><p>Morris 遍历是一种空间复杂度为 O(1) 的遍历算法。它通过修改树的结构（建立临时线索）来避免使用栈。核心思想是：找到当前节点左子树的最右节点，将其右指针指向当前节点，从而在遍历完左子树后能回到当前节点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n<td>代码最简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代（栈）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n<td>避免栈溢出风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Morris</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>不需要额外空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 h 为树的高度，最坏情况 h = n（退化为链表），最好情况 h = log n（完全二叉树）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"递归法\">递归法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function inorderTraversal(root: TreeNode | null): number[] {&#10;  const result: number[] = [];&#10;&#10;  const dfs = (node: TreeNode | null): void =&gt; {&#10;    if (node === null) {&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;    dfs(node.left);&#10;    result.push(node.val);&#10;    dfs(node.right);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  dfs(root);&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inorderTraversal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.left);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"迭代法-推荐\">迭代法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function inorderTraversal(root: TreeNode | null): number[] {&#10;  const result: number[] = [];&#10;  const stack: TreeNode[] = [];&#10;  let current = root;&#10;&#10;  while (current !== null || stack.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    while (current !== null) {&#10;      stack.push(current);&#10;      current = current.left;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    current = stack.pop()!;&#10;    result.push(current.val);&#10;    current = current.right;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inorderTraversal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"c